Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:09.36,Shochiku,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\blur1.333\fry-0.44\frx-0.29\frz0.6639\pos(485,521)}Shochiku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brought you some tea, Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea, tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No... doesn't seem like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help me!\N- Oh, I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really saved me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Princess Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Mario, are a very brave knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I hide\N here for a while, Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Peach, sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's King Koopa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss of those monsters just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made a mess of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,G-G-Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I got no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, come at me! Come on...\N- Go! Go! Ma-ri-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've caught you, Peach, sweetie. \N- Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back out here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the matter? \N- Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach has been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She came here asking me to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep and you can \Ndream what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, though, just who was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure was cute.
