Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Miss Endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'll bake a cake today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A delicious cake calls \Nfor the best ingredients!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We have everything you need in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, wheat flour, butter, sugar,\N eggs, milk, baking powder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness! Are you expecting me to make a cake out of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he try to make a\N fool out of me! Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for shopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Bro? You've been like this all morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bro! Where'd you get this from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mystical gem from Toad legend that's been passed down since long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it is! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... See? Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"This stone shall guide its master\N to a Land of Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The fields bloom with glittering emeralds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden mushrooms grow by the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The night is filled with diamond stars!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask directory assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, Mario, my boy, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been looking for ya'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, whatever. I'll send a \Nmessenger for ya', so come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they have the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they said they're picking me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick you up? What a bad joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no dog food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
