Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Mario Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pardon my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You were summoned here\N to the Mushroom Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,by none other than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mushroom Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mushroom Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say "Mushroom Kingdom?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the Mushroom Kingdom also known as the Land of Treasure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're gonna be... super rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Multimillionaires! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the Koopa Clan in a neighboring kingdom has this great evil king, Koopa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Koopa! Koopa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a big villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Koopa! Koopa! Oh, so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still bitter because Princess Peach turned down his marriage proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and has taken it out on our kingdom by trashing it and kidnapping Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trashing, trashing! Trashing, trashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Peach has been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trashing, trashing! Trashing, trashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Peach has been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Trashing, trashing! Trashing, trashing!{\i0}\N- Princess Peach...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Peach has been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, \NKing Koopa used his magic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to change the inhabitants of our kingdom into bricks, horsetails, and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are the only ones who can save our kingdom from this crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rescue Princess Peach and restore peace to this kingdom, however you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Male twins shall journey from\N the Kingdom of the East...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,donning sailor caps and overalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Knobby noses, goggling eyes, \Nand cute little mustaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kindhearted, but also money-seeking."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach believes in this legend, and\N that is why she sought the help of you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that was her plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mario! Please rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.53,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Princess will be forced to marry King Koopa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next Friday the Thirteenth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach... married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:44.27,TL Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs39}["Kuppa" is the Japanese word for gukbap, \Na Korean rice dish. King Koopa was named after it.]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if he's a Koopa or a Bibimbap, I'm not letting him get away with this! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, will you tell us where to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you head directly east from this point, you\N will most certainly reach King Koopa's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you must first pass through dangerous valleys and forests, steep mountains, and vast oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd sure be nice if we could take a non-stop flight on a plane or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But, in order to defeat King \NKoopa, especially his magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you must obtain the strength\N of the three Power-Ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The three Power-Ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, three items with unusual powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the Mushroom, the Flower, and the Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mushroom, the Flower, and the Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,However, King Koopa's henchmen have separated the Mushroom, the Flower, and the Star,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,sealed their magical powers, \Nand hid them somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So finding those three Power-Ups is our top priority, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! You can count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you'll go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are as grand as the legend says, Mario. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a piece of cake! Come on, Luigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are gonna get paid lots for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd accept gold coins, you'll find some buried here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take as many of those as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:12:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's the stuff, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! I'll dig up all the coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you run along too, Kibidango.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure they don't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for your success!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:21.03,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Doki-doki-doki Do it meromero sa\NHeart thumpin' thumpin', Do it, I'm crazy 'bout you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:24.07,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kimi no namida de koi ni waapu\NYour tears make me warp into love
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.74,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Love You
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:30.00,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Want You
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:37.42,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Mou naku na yo Baby Oira ga tsuiteru ze\NDon't cry anymore, Baby, I'm right here for you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:45.30,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Matte na yo Piichi-hime\NJust sit tight, Princess Peach
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:52.19,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tasuke ni umi koe yama koe\NTo rescue you, we'll go past the seas, past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:57.73,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tani koe, oka koete\Npast the valleys, and past the hills
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:03.37,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super dakedo I don't know\NWe are Super, but I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:14.37,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super dakedo What to do with my Love\NWe are Super, but, What to do with my Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I sure am hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna eat some steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And some chicken and hamburgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eels, tempura, and oyako-don.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Curry, pilaf, and spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, crêpes, and chocolate parfaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yakitori, edamame, and cold tofu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you steal \Nsomeone's dreams like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Burp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm even hungrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be having \Ntrouble with a lack of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir! If you've got something to eat, please share it with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We do know where there's a \Nvalley of delicious mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I love mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro! I'm gonna go get some mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nom, nom, nom...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.32,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Luigi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Bro! What took ya' so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Don't hold back, Bro! You eat up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-These are laughing-shrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, snap out of it, Luigi!\N- What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These are crying-shrooms, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if I feed him another laughing-shroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,they should cancel each other out \Nand he'll go back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why, you! Why, you! Why, you! Why, you!\N- Ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck, man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now you've really made me mad!\N- Th-That was an anger-shroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck, man? What the heck, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alley-oop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? Wh-Wh-What the...? What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Take that! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alley-oop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys, this food looks kinda weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me test it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow! My tummy hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it. We can't eat this rotten food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom! Can't ya' get us something nicer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a Hamburg steaks or some croquettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want steak! I wanna eat steak!\N- Hamburg steak! I wanna eat a Hamburg steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hamburg steak! \N- Steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Luigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks to you! Sorry I'm \Nso rotten! I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get down from here, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If descent is impossible, then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ascending is our only choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ascending?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of the three Power-Ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the Mushroom of Truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins! Coins! Coins! Coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins! Coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My gold coins...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The coins...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for freeing us from King Koopa's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the mushroom retainer \NToad, Princess Peach's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, friends, let us thank them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Mario, please take \Nthis Super Mushroom with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is this the Power-Up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And please rescue Princess Peach as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:59.79,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Doki-doki-doki Do it meromero sa\NHeart thumpin' thumpin', Do it, I'm crazy 'bout you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.79,0:22:02.83,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kimi no namida de koi ni waapu\NYour tears make me warp into love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:05.50,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Love You
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.21,0:22:08.76,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Want You
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:16.18,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Mou naku na yo Baby Oira ga tsuiteru ze\NDon't cry anymore, Baby, I'm right here for you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:24.06,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Matte na yo Piichi-hime\NJust sit tight, Princess Peach
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:30.95,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tasuke ni umi koe yama koe\NTo rescue you, we'll go past the seas, past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:36.49,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tani koe, oka koete\Npast the valleys, and past the hills
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:46.43,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super dakedo What to do with my Love\NWe are Super, but, What to do with my Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:48.26,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super\NWe are Super
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.51,0:22:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.67,0:23:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to figure out \Nthe best way to go east.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There are countless courses that lead east.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The wayside grass course, the catnap \Ncourse, the flower garden course...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have many options such as those, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower garden course, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrounded by beautiful flowers and their beautiful aromas, it truly is a luxurious course to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.35,0:23:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The flower garden course...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes you wish they had a treasure-hunting course...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe, the Flower Power-Up \Nmight be in that garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's decided then!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:37.56,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Matte na yo Piichi-hime\NJust sit tight, Princess Peach
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.27,0:23:44.45,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tasuke ni umi koe yama koe\NTo rescue you, we'll go past the seas, past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:49.99,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tani koe, oka koete\Npast the valleys, and past the hills
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:55.46,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super dakedo I don't know\NWe are Super, but I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.45,0:23:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What an indescribably beautiful smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.58,0:23:58.42,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super\NWe are Super
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why do I feel so refereshed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This place feels so soothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.46,0:24:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.59,0:24:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The color, the shine, the gracefulness...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take a little nap...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pepper! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu, Jugemu, Jugemu, Jugemu...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:25.71,TL Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs60}[In Japanese, Lakitu is called "Jugemu" and his Spinies are called "Paipo," a reference to the main character's name from the famous folktale.]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.21,0:25:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu, Jugemu, Jugemu Spinies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.97,0:25:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! How dare you\N bully my cute little flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.47,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Cute little flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean those man-eating ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.64,0:25:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to lure you boys here and feed you to my cute little flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But we're not plant food!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.90,0:25:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just decide that on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it! Food has no right to\N speak with such rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Spine and spine and spine, spine, spine!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.62,0:26:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck? Not a single one hit us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.92,0:26:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the fun begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.09,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu, Jugemu, \NJugemu, Jugemu, Jugemu...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Budding forth with thunder, then with the summer \Nsun, they shall awaken from a long hibernation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all of you! Prick those \Nbad guys with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.58,0:26:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.09,0:26:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, no! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:26:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.27,0:27:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.07,0:27:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens to those \N mess with my flower field!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back! Stay back! Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the end for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the...? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.22,0:27:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu, Jugemu Spinies!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.73,0:27:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.82,0:27:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it, I did it, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.40,0:27:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.36,0:27:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did it! I did it! Victory is mine! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.44,0:28:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pleased! Now I must feed the prey to my cute little flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.35,0:28:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.93,0:28:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.58,0:28:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling prey?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.05,0:28:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What was that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro! Do something about these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.50,0:28:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, wait right there! Gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah... Woah... Woah...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.60,0:28:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay... Oops, stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.56,0:28:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then... Is this how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.15,0:28:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, oh, here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So the rainy season monsoon first?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the summer sun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then next is... uh, an autumn typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.95,0:28:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.87,0:28:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... after that... some snow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.62,0:28:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So I do this... And then \Nhe said something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.03,0:28:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu Spinies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.63,0:28:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jugemu, Jugemu...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.88,0:28:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Jugemu, Jugemu Spinies, Spinies...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.47,0:28:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.22,0:28:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Go! More. More.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.72,0:29:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.39,0:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.31,0:29:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.04,0:29:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for breaking King Koopa's magic spell on me, Master Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.63,0:29:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.26,0:29:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower of Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.96,0:29:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Power-Up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.67,0:29:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, hurry and take that to King Koopa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.34,0:29:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.39,0:29:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Darn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.85,0:29:51.44,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Doki-doki-doki Do it meromero sa\NHeart thumpin' thumpin', Do it, I'm crazy 'bout you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.44,0:29:54.48,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kimi no namida de koi ni waapu\NYour tears make me warp into love
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.77,0:29:57.15,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Love You
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.86,0:30:00.41,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Want You
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.03,0:30:07.83,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Mou naku na yo Baby Oira ga tsuiteru ze\NDon't cry anymore, Baby, I'm right here for you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.95,0:30:13.54,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kura-kura-kura Do it tomaranai\NDizzy, dizzy, dizzy, Do it, it doesn't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:16.79,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kimi no egao wa magunichuudo\NThe magnitude of your smile
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.79,0:30:19.34,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Love You
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.05,0:30:22.51,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Yes Yes Gonna Want You
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.18,0:30:30.02,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Inochigake sa Baby hi no naka mizu no naka\NI'll risk my life for you, Baby, through the fire, and through the water
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.89,0:30:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.31,0:30:37.90,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Matte na yo Piichi-hime\NJust sit tight, Princess Peach
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Mario Ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.61,0:30:44.79,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tasuke ni umi koe yama koe\NTo rescue you, we'll go past the seas, past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.48,0:30:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is very yummy, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.95,0:30:50.33,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tani koe, oka koete\Npast the valleys, and past the hills
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.79,0:30:53.29,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Boku-ra Super\NWe are Super
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.01,0:31:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Don't \Nmess up again this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.33,0:31:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.96,0:31:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.85,0:31:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Coin...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.02,0:31:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.24,0:31:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mario! There are tons over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.30,0:31:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold coins going all the way inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.33,0:31:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Coins! Coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.08,0:31:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.14,0:31:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.29,0:31:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-It's a real gold nugget!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.05,0:31:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've discovered a gold mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.03,0:32:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.45,0:32:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.26,0:32:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, do me a favor!\N Get us out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but we cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.54,0:32:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering someone's gold mine \Nwithout permission is a serious crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.60,0:32:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. It's our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But please, let us go!\N We need to rescue Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.43,0:32:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, the wedding between\N Princess Peach and the great King Koopa is tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.52,0:32:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It is sure to be a magnificent ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this, we should be highly rewarded too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.52,0:32:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.45,0:32:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you little scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.36,0:32:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This Hammer Brother is a master\N at throwing his hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.15,0:32:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So there better not be any funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.99,0:32:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spend the rest of your life\N watching the ocean from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.55,0:33:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.90,0:33:02.88,TL Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1}["Ono" = axe/hatchet/hammer]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.90,0:33:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, hammer...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.10,0:33:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fault for being distracted by the gold...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.17,0:33:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Princess Peach, I was so foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.18,0:33:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Amazing! There's more gold here than we could dig up in our lifetimes. Right, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.85,0:33:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That dummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Princess Peach...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.85,0:33:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Please come rescue me soon, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.02,0:33:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.90,0:33:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.29,0:33:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.67,0:33:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Peach, sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.24,0:33:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So about tonight's wedding, what \Nkind of wedding dress do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.66,0:33:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A pink one? A white one? Or maybe a...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.01,0:33:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I'd marry you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.55,0:33:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never go through with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:34:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But, I am the one who... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.17,0:34:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Loves you more than anyone else, Peach, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really loved me, you wouldn't put \Nme through this endless suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.97,0:34:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Peach, sweetie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.23,0:34:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make that face. Cheer up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.11,0:34:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... Let's play dress-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.65,0:34:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn into something amusing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy enough with the\N preparations for our wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.79,0:34:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Peach must play dress-up or she'll be upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.05,0:34:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.80,0:34:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O-O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.29,0:34:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if it's for you, Peach, sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.52,0:34:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, change into a Pokero.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.52,0:34:41.48,TL Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs40}Note: Here Peach is making up terms that don't exist, \Nso King Koopa is guessing as to what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Pokero?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.06,0:34:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.93,0:34:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My! How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.90,0:34:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, next try a Buchimonta!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.14,0:34:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"Buchimonta?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.04,0:34:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"Buchimonta..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.11,0:34:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- How lovely!\N- I guess this is about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.61,0:34:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, this time around I'd like you to turn into something small and cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Something small and cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.19,0:34:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.24,0:35:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a little teddy bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love those!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.71,0:35:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.63,0:35:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.34,0:35:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.29,0:35:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this. But this was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That sort of trickery won't\N work on me, Peach, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.80,0:35:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now...\N - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.94,0:35:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,, I hope you won't think of any more \Nsilly things like trying to escape from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.61,0:35:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.99,0:35:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario will come rescue me any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll knock you out for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario? He's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.28,0:35:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he will!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.20,0:35:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he will!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I received a message\N from one of my minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He said they've captured this Mario guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.64,0:35:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Y-You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.65,0:35:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.82,0:35:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just saying that so I'll give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lies won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.72,0:36:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whether you believe \Nme or not is your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, you {\i1}will{\i0\fsp2.667} {\fsp0}marry me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.41,0:36:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.31,0:36:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It... It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.99,0:36:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.19,0:36:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:34.96,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Hito o aishitara shiawase ni nareru kitto itsuka\NThe day I fall in love and find happiness will surely come...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.38,0:36:44.47,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Kokoro no kyanbasu anata no sugata utsushidasu\NYour figure is reflected in the canvas of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.47,0:36:47.71,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Sono kami mo hohoemi mo\NAs are your hair and your smile
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.77,0:37:00.66,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}I Love You... Mukashi no Adamu to Ibu ga\NI Love You... These are the words that Adam and Eve used
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.57,0:36:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Bro, what're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.57,0:37:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, I'm busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.70,0:37:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo! Shoo, shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.70,0:37:15.71,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}I Love You... Omoi o tsutaeta kotoba\NI Love You... to convey their feelings so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Woof! Mario! Woof! Woof! Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.38,0:37:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys feel free to do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.63,0:37:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am perfectly content where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.88,0:37:19.68,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Ima dake wa...\NJust for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.05,0:37:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.22,0:37:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Smooch, smooch, smooch...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.76,0:37:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.47,0:37:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Oh, my. Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.89,0:37:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops. Sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.89,0:37:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.35,0:37:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.32,0:37:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.79,0:37:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.84,0:37:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.21,0:38:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luigi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.30,0:38:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All the gold nuggets turned into rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.63,0:38:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.75,0:38:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.65,0:38:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the Star!\N- The Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.46,0:38:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Wait up! Woah, woah, woah...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.36,0:39:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.95,0:39:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.67,0:39:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.42,0:40:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.47,0:40:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.43,0:40:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.22,0:40:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't budge. How are we \Ngonna get this thing to open?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.19,0:40:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm such a pretty ballerina, Mr. Clam. Lalala...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you jerk! Son of a...! \NGimme back the Star! Come on! Gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.30,0:40:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.13,0:40:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.59,0:40:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Glittering Star of Invincibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've gathered all three!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.60,0:40:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Cheep Cheep! Swim for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.32,0:41:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.23,0:41:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.41,0:41:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro! Help me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.35,0:41:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.79,0:42:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Alley-oop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.63,0:42:07.80,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Jitto mitsumete\NStare closely
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.34,0:42:11.30,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Mahou no booru\Ninto the magic ball
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.51,0:42:18.89,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Anata to ikiru mirai ga ima\NA future in which I live alongside you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:22.60,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Utsuru hazu yo\Nshould now show itself
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.19,0:42:29.48,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Tatoe fukou ga\NI don't mind it if misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.90,0:42:32.94,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Mattete mo ii\Nis awaiting us
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.99,0:42:40.45,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Ai ga sasurau unmei dake\NBecause the only fate I want
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.91,0:42:44.12,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Shiritai kara\Nis one where our love wanders
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.04,0:42:54.43,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Shiroi kiri ga harete yuku wa\NThe white fog lifts away
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.63,0:43:03.23,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Soshite kataku dakishimeau\NAnd then we embrace tightly
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.52,0:43:08.23,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\fs39\an7\pos(56.64,53.333)}Futari\NJust the two of us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.35,0:43:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, it's a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.19,0:43:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.87,0:43:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. I thought the wedding was\N supposed to be on the night of a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.04,0:43:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's finally time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach, we shall now\N be on our way to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.78,0:43:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning portside!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.51,0:43:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, that was too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.55,0:43:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hard starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.10,0:43:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I can't stop the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.59,0:44:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness, it's so nice \Nto see you in such high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.35,0:44:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.30,0:44:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made sure that Mario guy \Nwon't be able to do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.48,0:44:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done. You shall be well rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.83,0:44:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, is my sweetie Peach ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.15,0:44:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paint, paint, pat, pat.\N- Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.86,0:44:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint, paint, pat, pat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paint, paint, pat, pat.\N- Thicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.99,0:44:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, paint, pat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.16,0:44:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- And now the veil, and... tah-dah! \N- Okay, and now for some powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.45,0:44:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, pat, pat, pat.\N- Very pretty. Very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.37,0:44:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.04,0:44:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.75,0:44:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take much more\N of this embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.70,0:45:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, sweetie! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.10,0:45:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There. The bridal throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.23,0:45:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, begin the ceremony at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.23,0:45:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.69,0:45:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mario, they must have \Ncaptured you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.65,0:45:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.91,0:45:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.58,0:45:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Great King Koopa, takest thou Princess Peach as thy lawfully wedded wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.96,0:45:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilt thou vow to love her and to dedicate\N thyself to the Koopa Clan's prosperity
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as thou art alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.04,0:45:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.86,0:45:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach, takest thou the Great King Koopa as thy lawfully wedded husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.69,0:45:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilt thou vow to devote thy love to \Nthe prosperity of the Koopa Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.77,0:45:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as thou art alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.16,0:46:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You will, right, Peach, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.54,0:46:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.25,0:46:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.04,0:46:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Peach, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.54,0:46:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there,\N say something! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.08,0:46:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.71,0:46:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all? Can't you say \Nanything more? With a smile too?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.31,0:46:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.92,0:46:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.42,0:46:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have I, Peach,\N been waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.76,0:46:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course! Of course you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.76,0:46:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you've finally come to rescue me, Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.68,0:46:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! He finally came to rescue...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.48,0:46:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.10,0:46:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.85,0:46:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange looking airship is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.85,0:46:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.78,0:46:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Impudent pigs! Shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.55,0:47:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.38,0:47:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they interrupt\N my precious wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.30,0:47:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.56,0:47:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Th-This wasn't supposed to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.85,0:47:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.94,0:47:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.19,0:47:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue the ceremony in the sealed room! Come, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.69,0:47:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.07,0:47:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.28,0:47:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.90,0:47:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.37,0:47:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret path!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.13,0:47:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.33,0:47:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.23,0:48:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.95,0:48:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.66,0:48:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One of those entrances must \Nlead to King Koopa's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.07,0:48:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.38,0:48:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And the moth flies into the flame! \NThis is an infernal area of fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.35,0:48:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to pass, \Nyou'd better use these lifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.68,0:48:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's {\i1}heat{\i0\fsp12} {\fsp0}things up even more with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.14,0:48:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some nice fireballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.69,0:48:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.78,0:48:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.62,0:48:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.42,0:49:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins, coins, coins, coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.42,0:49:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins, coins, coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.92,0:49:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins, coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.48,0:49:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Coins, coins, coins, co...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.43,0:49:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.03,0:49:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.75,0:49:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.84,0:49:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My, oh my. What a nice, hot bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.49,0:50:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, please exchange \Nthe engagement rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.78,0:50:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, sweetie, {\i1}please accept my ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.16,0:50:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With your cute little hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.21,0:50:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.42,0:50:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I guess it was too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.44,0:50:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I guess if it's more like a bracelet, that just means my love is even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.84,0:50:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.76,0:50:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, don't be mad! \NI'll have it remade for you at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.72,0:50:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.92,0:51:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.29,0:51:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.30,0:51:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.43,0:51:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.01,0:51:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin my precious wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.56,0:51:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what happens to those who oppose me?! Let me show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.73,0:51:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.78,0:51:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.99,0:51:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.53,0:51:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.04,0:51:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Mario, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.21,0:51:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Princess Peach!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.88,0:51:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The three Power-Ups, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.80,0:51:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, th-that's right! These!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.59,0:51:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to swallow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.26,0:52:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.43,0:52:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What? Get off, get off, get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.02,0:52:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.61,0:52:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.20,0:52:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.49,0:52:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mario Rice Seasoning! I love this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.35,0:52:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.04,0:52:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yum, yum, yum! \N- Watch out, Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.54,0:52:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.71,0:52:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Star! The Star...!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, shall I deliver the final blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.97,0:52:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Don't hurt Mario anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.89,0:52:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you ask \Nof me. Just spare Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.02,0:52:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.94,0:52:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become your bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.65,0:52:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So please... Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.69,0:52:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you'll become my bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.78,0:52:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Princess Peach! \NYou can't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.83,0:53:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So please... I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.79,0:53:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He already ate the Mushroom \Nand Flower Power-Ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.43,0:53:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let him live, things might get a lot more inconvenient for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.09,0:53:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alley-oop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.13,0:53:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Bro, so this is where you've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.17,0:53:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! You dropped the Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.18,0:53:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Star! Throw it into my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.43,0:53:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.14,0:53:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.06,0:53:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.53,0:53:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, but it doesn't look that tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.44,0:53:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Star!\N- Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.27,0:53:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you learned your lesson, Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.58,0:53:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be flattened like a pancake? Well? Well? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.66,0:53:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel? \NHow does it feel? How does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.46,0:53:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Woah, woah! Um...\N- Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.42,0:53:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.21,0:53:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.46,0:53:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach, thank goodness you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.13,0:53:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.22,0:54:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it, King Koopa!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.14,0:54:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two! Uppercut!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.48,0:54:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.52,0:54:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leggo! Leggo! Leggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.31,0:54:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Leggo! Leggo of me! Leggo of me!\N- Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.96,0:54:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you win this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.79,0:54:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.63,0:54:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.04,0:54:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, you really are a wonderful hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.40,0:54:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.86,0:54:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.52,0:55:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the spell is broken, \Neverything has returned to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.82,0:55:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.52,0:55:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.25,0:55:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! I almost forgot...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.66,0:55:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.24,0:55:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Well then, where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.66,0:55:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When you came to my house,\N Princess, you dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.39,0:55:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.30,0:55:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wearing this\N ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.03,0:55:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.31,0:55:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that someday, a wonderful prince\N who has the same necklace will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.28,0:55:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The same necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.81,0:55:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.89,0:55:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Hey, didn't we have a necklace just like this back at the shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.92,0:55:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.57,0:55:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Peach, fear not!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.57,0:55:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Mario, promise to find that \Nmatching necklace for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.83,0:55:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.01,0:56:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.52,0:56:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the prince of the\N neighboring Flower Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.98,0:56:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.53,0:56:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Prince Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.19,0:56:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way to visit the Princess, I was unwittingly turned into a dog by King Koopa's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.07,0:56:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Which means the Princess' real fiancé is...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.16,0:56:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, Luigi, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.04,0:56:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You men are my saviors. You are true heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.79,0:56:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.38,0:56:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Hang in there, Mario! Mario!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.67,0:56:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your happiness is my happiness, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.87,0:56:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.56,0:56:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.61,0:57:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario, Luigi, I wish you could stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have our shop to look after.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.58,0:57:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you two, it will be very lonely here in the Mushroom Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.54,0:57:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, cut it out. If some bad guys come back, we'll come rescue you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.17,0:57:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Luigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.21,0:57:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's go, Luigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.80,0:57:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.18,0:57:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Luigi! Take care, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.89,0:57:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,True courage is born from true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.38,0:57:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the true Power-Up, \Nthe symbol of a hero, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:57.86,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs40}Hito o aishitara shiawase ni nareru kitto itsuka\NThe day I fall in love and find happiness will surely come...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:07.25,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs80}Kokoro no kyanbasu anata no sugata utsushidasu\NYour figure is reflected in the canvas of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.25,0:58:11.05,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Sono kami mo hohoemi mo\NAs are your hair and your smile
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.34,0:58:18.14,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs40}Tokai no janguru kanashimi o daite\NI lie in this metropolitan jungle, embracing my sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.73,0:58:23.40,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Yoru no shijima\Nin the silence of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.27,0:58:27.78,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Nemurenai hi ni wa\NOn the days I cannot sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.65,0:58:32.99,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Tooku shiosai kaze ni nori\Nthe roar of the ocean rides the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.99,0:58:37.74,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Mimimoto ni hibiku\Nand echoes in my ears from far away
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.74,0:58:49.96,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs40}I Love You... Mukashi no Adam to Eve ga\NI Love You... These are the words that Adam and Eve used
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.42,0:59:05.15,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs40}I Love You... Omoi o tsutaeta kotoba\NI Love You... to convey their feelings so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.77,0:59:27.54,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\b1\fs40}Ima dake wa me o tojite kono mune ni sotto...\NJust for now, close your eyes and lay on my chest, softly...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:35.38,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\b1\}Ryoute ippai no shiawase o tsunde\NLet's gather happiness, enough to fill our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.04,0:59:40.72,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Ano madobe ni\Nupon that windowsill
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.60,0:59:45.19,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,{\b1}Kokoro o kesarete\NIf our hearts were erased,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.06,0:59:55.65,Singing (TOP),,1,1,0,,{\b1\fs40}Futatabi meguri aetara wakaru darou\Nand we met once again, we'd still recognize each other
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.77,1:00:29.81,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fs49)}Restored Version by: FemboyFilms\NProject Managers: nemu, Tanks\NOriginal 16mm Scan Courtesy of: Carnivol\NColor Correction: Quazza\NFilm Restoration: nemu, Quazza\NVideo Encoding: Shiniori (This Downscale)\Nnemu(The Original 2K file),\NAudio Capture/Sync: Japanese Hoarder, Tanks\NOriginal Translation: m.3.3.w Fansubs\NSubtitle Editing: Blu-Subs, nemu (Original)\NTranslation Check: bluesun, Japanese Hoarder, nemu
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.81,1:00:38.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fs49)}Title Typesets: SakoeraTyan\NQuality Check:\NAzelf89, SakoeraTyan,\NVenny, ZeroCool\N\NSpecial Thanks:\NForest of Illusion\NMartyMcflies\NOur Supporters\N\NThanks for watching!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.50,1:00:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd bake a delicious apple pie today.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.91,1:00:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a great idea, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.93,1:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got all the perfect ingredients in the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.00,1:00:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.84,1:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need flour, apples, butter, milk...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.22,1:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Ma'am.
Comment: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"この人でなし！"
Comment: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.90,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,It does sound like "Saomatsu-sensei" to me as well, but I don't know the context here. Maybe the vinyl record has the lyrics.
Comment: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"水臭い" means "having a distant attitude to someone"
Comment: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"これはキノピオ神話に古くから伝わる幻の宝石だぜ"
Comment: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"失礼なこと平にご容赦"
Comment: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"マドロスシャッポに繋ぎのズボン"
Comment: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"丸鼻ギョロ目にチョビ髭かわいい"
Comment: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"情にもろいが金にも弱い"
Comment: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"焼き鳥、枝豆、冷奴..."
Comment: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"あったまきたぜ、もう！"
Comment: 0,0:22:59.67,0:23:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"東へ行くにはどうやって行けばいいのやらと思案に暮れておるところです"
Comment: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"ああこの清々しさは一体何なんだ"
Comment: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"黙り！エサの分際で生意気言うとは許せん"
Comment: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"あっち行け あっち行け あっちあっちへ！来るな！"
Comment: 0,0:28:47.62,0:28:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"よっとこら うん、そんで...えー何か言ってたぞ"
Comment: 0,0:31:53.05,0:31:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"おれ達は金鉱を掘り当てたんだ！"
Comment: 0,0:32:53.99,0:32:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"まあせいぜいそっから海を眺めて暮らすこってすなあ"
Comment: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"すげえすげえ！これじゃ一生かかっても掘りつくせないね。ね、兄貴？"
Comment: 0,0:35:12.29,0:35:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"ごめんね でもこうするより仕方なかったの"
Comment: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"あんたなんかコテンパンにのされちゃうわよ"
Comment: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,TL CHECK. Is any more of his barking understandable? -> No.
Comment: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,TL CHECK. Is any of Kibidango's muttering after this understandable? -> No.
Comment: 0,0:40:45.59,0:40:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,TL CHECK. Is any of Kibidango's muttering after this understandable? -> No.
Comment: 0,0:44:54.75,0:44:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"付きあってらんないわ"
Comment: 0,0:45:32.58,0:45:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"クッパ大王さま 汝 (なんじ) はピーチ姫を妻とし"
Comment: 0,0:45:36.96,0:45:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"末永く愛し カメ一族繁栄のために尽くすことを誓いますか"
Comment: 0,0:45:47.86,0:45:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"ピーチ姫 汝はクッパ大王様を夫とし"
Comment: 0,0:45:51.76,0:45:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"末永くカメ一族の繁栄のために愛を捧げることを誓いますか"
Comment: 0,0:46:18.42,0:46:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"ピーチ どれほどこの時を待ちわびていたことか"
Comment: 0,0:46:21.76,0:46:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"そそそそ そうだろうとも そうだろうとも"
Comment: 0,0:47:11.85,0:47:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"さっさとひっ捕らえてこい！"
Comment: 0,0:47:16.19,0:47:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"式は開かずの間で行う 来い司祭！"
Comment: 0,0:50:30.76,0:50:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"ごめん 怒んないで すぐ作り直してくるから"
Comment: 0,0:51:20.01,0:51:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"よくもワシの結婚式を台無しにしてくれたな！"
Comment: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"あたしの事はいいの"
Comment: 0,0:53:07.43,0:53:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"このまま生かしておくと 私にとって甚だ都合が悪いことになる"
Comment: 0,0:55:17.30,0:55:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"これ 生まれた時からずっと肌身離さず着けていた"
